BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:friends-from-afar-2026@flavorsfromafar.com
DTSTAMP:20261105T051327Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261105T051327Z
SEQUENCE:3
DTSTART:20261126T013000Z
DTEND:20261126T060000Z
SUMMARY:Friends From Afar
DESCRIPTION:A Pan-African Friendsgiving in Hollywood on November 25\, with 
 two seatings\, a three-course dinner\, live Afrobeats DJ\, and a Thanksgiv
 ing to-go plate.\nSeatings: 5:30 PM & 8 PM (Los Angeles time).\nThree-cour
 se Pan-African prix fixe dinner with a choice of turkey\, beef\, fish\, or
  vegetarian\nNon-alcoholic welcome beverage\nLive DJ spinning Afrobeats\nA
  communal table\, or a private table for your group\nA Thanksgiving Day to
 -go plate with turkey\, sides\, and dessert\nEarly bird: $65 through 2026-
 11-15\nRegular: $75\nOnly 40 seats per seating. Prepaid. No refunds after 
 November 20\; tickets can be transferred to a friend.\nWine and beer sold 
 separately. Wine Wednesday pricing all night: $10 glasses of African wine.
 \nA calendar entry is not a reservation. View the event page for current d
 etails and booking.
LOCATION:5652 Hollywood Blvd\, Los Angeles\, CA 90028
URL:https://www.flavorsfromafar.com/events/friendsgiving-los-angeles-2026
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
